---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Services from '../../../components/Services.astro';
import StatsBar from '../../../components/StatsBar.astro';
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from '../../../i18n/utils';

const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(lang);

const title = 'Appliance Repair Varna | In-Home Service RotoRem';
const description = 'Professional appliance repair service in Varna - Fast in-home repair the same day - Quality guarantee - Contact us at 089 834 0982!';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-primary-dark text-white py-16">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
        Professional Appliance Repair in Varna
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Professional home appliance repairs in Varna and surrounding areas. Fast on-site service with quality guarantee.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-blue-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Visit and diagnostics in Varna - 20.46 EUR
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
            <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
          </svg>
          Send Email
        </a>
        <a href="tel:0898340982" class="bg-accent text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-accent-dark transition-colors shadow-lg">
          Call 089 834 0982
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats Bar -->
  <StatsBar />

  <!-- Main Services Section -->
  <Services />

  <!-- Why Choose Our Services -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-gray-50">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Why Choose Our Services?</h2>
        <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-accent mx-auto my-4"></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">On-Site Service</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">We come directly to your home in Varna. No need to transport heavy appliances to a repair shop.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Fast Response</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">In most cases we repair appliances the same day. Quick diagnosis and efficient solution.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Warranty</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">All repairs come with warranty for workmanship quality and used parts.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"></path>
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Serving All Varna</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">We provide services in neighborhoods: Chayka, Mladost, Asparuhovo, Levski, V. Varnenchik and center.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">All Brands</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">We repair appliances from all major brands: Bosch, Samsung, LG, Whirlpool, Indesit and others.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
              <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Fair Pricing</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Visit and diagnostics: Varna - 20.46 EUR. Clear prices with no hidden fees. You know the cost before we start.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Process -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">How Our Service Works</h2>
        <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-accent mx-auto my-4"></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-xl font-bold">1</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Call Us</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Contact us by phone or book online</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-xl font-bold">2</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Visit</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Our technician arrives at the scheduled time</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-xl font-bold">3</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Diagnosis</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Free diagnosis and repair quote</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-xl font-bold">4</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Repair</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Quality repair with work warranty</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-primary-dark text-white py-16 px-6 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Need appliance repair in Varna?</h2>
    <p class="text-xl mb-8 text-blue-100">Call now for fast on-site service!</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-6">
      <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
          <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
        </svg>
        Send Email
      </a>
      <a href="tel:0898340982" class="bg-accent text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-accent-dark transition-colors shadow-lg">
        Call 089 834 0982
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="text-blue-100">
      <p class="text-sm">Visit and diagnostics: Varna - 20.46 EUR | Quality guarantee | Service in Varna</p>
    </div>
  </section>

<!-- SEO helper text -->
  <div class="rotorem-seo-text">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <p>When your washing machine stops, your oven fails, or your boiler breaks at the worst possible time, it creates a real problem at home. RotoRem offers a fast and practical solution with on-site diagnostics and repair. We work across the whole city and nearby areas, so you get help without unnecessary waiting.</p>
      <h2>What home appliance repairs we provide in Varna</h2>
      <p>Appliance issues often happen suddenly. Our home appliance service handles a wide range of faults, from minor defects to more serious technical problems.</p>
      <p>If your washing machine is blocked or not draining, you can rely on our professional <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/washing-machine-repair/">washing machine repair</a>. For dryers with heating or sensor issues, we provide fast <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/dryer-repair/">dryer repair</a>, including installation for new units. For leaks or program errors, we offer effective <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/dishwasher-repair/">dishwasher repair</a>.</p>
      <p>We also provide <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/electrical-services/">electrical services</a> in Varna for small and large home installation issues, as well as <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/boiler-repair/">boiler repair and cleaning</a> for leaks, limescale buildup, or no hot water. For kitchen appliances, we offer <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/oven-repair/">oven repair</a>, cooktop repair, and cooker repair when heating is uneven or the unit does not start.</p>
      <p>We also install new appliances such as washing machines, dryers, boilers, dishwashers, and ovens with professional setup tailored to your household. Our technicians make sure everything is installed correctly and safely for long-term performance.</p>
      <p>RotoRem is prepared to respond in all kinds of situations, with the goal of saving time and costs through efficient in-home repair.</p>
      <h2>Which brands we service in Varna</h2>
      <p>We work with all major appliance brands, which allows us to provide flexible solutions in different situations. We repair Bosch, Whirlpool, Samsung, LG, Gorenje, Electrolux, and many others. We know the specifics of each model and use suitable parts when needed. This ensures longer-lasting results and lower risk of repeated faults.</p>
      <h2>Areas in Varna we cover</h2>
      <p>Our appliance service covers all city districts and nearby areas. We work in Chaika, Levski, Vladislav Varnenchik, Mladost, Asparuhovo, Galata, and central Varna. We also visit addresses up to 20 km outside the city, so we can help in more remote locations as well.</p>
      <h2>How the repair process works</h2>
      <p>The process starts with on-site inspection and diagnostics to identify the exact cause of the problem. Then you receive a clear repair quote. After approval, we proceed with the repair using suitable tools and parts. At the end, the appliance is tested to make sure it works properly.</p>
      <h2>Why choose RotoRem appliance service</h2>
      <p>Clients choose us when they need reliable appliance repair in Varna and clear communication. Our practical experience enables fast diagnostics and effective solutions. We work at your address, saving you time and transport. Every repair comes with warranty and transparent pricing. <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/contact/">Contact us</a> now and book a convenient visit.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

